{"slug":"Prison-Life-BYPASS-NOCLIP-ANTICHEAT-113144","_id":"69950c0c439e779867fcc2ac","title":"BYPASS NOCLIP ANTICHEAT","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d3e","gameId":155615604,"name":"Prison Life","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-4e541a0e7376f0235f0eeb0192e96ddb-eba40abb4f32.png","placeId":155615604},"features":"An anticheat was introduced to prison life by Aesthetical that stops you from noclipping. It does so by repetitively setting your Torso and Head \"CanCollide\" properties to true. This script bypasses it, so you can now start noclipping with infinite yield or something again. Works as of February 17th, tested by myself.\n\nDOES NOT WORK ON SHITTY EXECS","tags":["prisonlife","noclip","roblox","anticheat","hook"],"script":"local OldIndex\n\nOldIndex = hookmetamethod(game, '__newindex', function(self, property, value)\n    if tostring(self) == \"Head\" and property == \"CanCollide\" and not checkcaller() then\n        return\n    elseif tostring(self) == \"Torso\" and property == \"CanCollide\" and not checkcaller() then\n        return\n    end\n    return OldIndex(self, property, value)\nend)","owner":{"_id":"62fae888297097657cbac777","username":"skid221","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.png","status":"offline","id":"62fae888297097657cbac777","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":2035,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-8e16b433df6f2c94391865bc438e076a-bfa26800bfff.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-18T00:47:08.896Z","executes":1199,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69950c0c439e779867fcc2af","editBy":{"_id":"62fae888297097657cbac777","username":"skid221","status":"offline","id":"62fae888297097657cbac777"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-02-18T00:47:08.897Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69950c704fa375844d0175a9","commentBy":{"_id":"6985cd7f4b